sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Person as Person
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+Person: terminate(reason)
    Note over Person: Policies: personRead, personWrite, personExecute
    Note over Person: Guards (2)
    Person->>Person: guard[0]: self.status == #quot;active#quot; or self.status == #quot;inactive#quot;
    Person->>Person: guard[1]: roleAllows(user.role, #quot;adminAccess#quot;)
    Person->>Person: mutate.status
    Person->>Person: mutate.terminationDate
    Person->>Person: mutate.deletedAt
    Person->>EventBus: emit PersonTerminated on person.terminated
    Person-->>-Client: void